        "content": "### 🛠️ Observability Control Panel\n\nThis dashboard consolidates system observability:\n\n*   **Logs:** The Loki panel on the left shows real-time logs with automatic `trace_id` correlation links.\n*   **Traces (OpenTelemetry):** Click any trace link or open [Jaeger UI](http://localhost:16686) to inspect end-to-end distributed spans.\n*   **Errors (Sentry/GlitchTip):** Open [GlitchTip Console](http://localhost:8075) for exception stack traces and release tracking.\n*   **Prometheus Alerting:** High 5xx rate and connection pool saturation trigger instant alerts.\n"
